// Computes how many calendar weeks a month spans, given the month number `m`
// (1 = January, ..., 12 = December) and the weekday index `d` (1 = Monday, ..., 7 = Sunday)
// on which the first of the month falls.
//
// A non‐leap year is assumed, and weeks are counted in a standard 7‐day grid,
